---
title: "create_staking_rewards (Sui Framework: balance)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_sender: check ctx.sender() == @0x0
    q_check_sender --> q_abort_sender: sender != @0x0
    q_abort_sender --> [*]: abort ENotSystemAddress
    q_check_sender --> q_check_type: sender == @0x0
    q_check_type --> q_abort_type: T != SUI type
    q_abort_type --> [*]: abort ENotSUI
    q_check_type --> q_create: T == SUI type
    q_create --> [*]: return Balance(value) without supply increase

    note right of q_create
        INV-001: only system address (@0x0) can create staking rewards
        INV-002: only SUI type allowed - no arbitrary token inflation
        INV-003: CAUTION - creates Balance without increasing Supply
    end note
